<title>USA: Arvin sees 1997 EPS in $2.05 to $2.15 range.</title>
<headline>Arvin sees 1997 EPS in $2.05 to $2.15 range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arvin Industries Inc said on Friday it expects to achieve earnings in the $2.05 to $2.15 range for 1997, up about 25 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>The company said it would reach this goal by a combination of productivity and pricing improvements and better asset management.</p>
